  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<color=#ffd126>BET PER LINE: 1</color>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <color=#ffd126>50 LINES</color>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_1
    value: <style=title><size=34><color=#13ebff>WILD</style></size></color>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '5 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3
      <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: "<size=26>- Appears on all reels and substitutes for all\n   symbols.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_2
    value: <style=title><size=34><color=#13ebff>RANDOM JACKPOT FEATURE</style></size></color>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_2
    value: "<size=26>- In any played spin player can randomly\n   trigger <style=coinColor><b>Wheel
      of Jackpots</b></style>, which can award\n   either one of two <b>Jackpots</b>
      or <b>Coin Prize</b>.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_4
    value: <style=title><size=34><color=#13ebff>3 WILD PROGRESSIONS</style></size></color>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_4
    value: "<size=24>- <b>3 Wild Progressions</b> are available during both\n   Base
      Game & Free Game. \n\n- <b>Wild Progressions</b> are presented as Wilds and\n  
      come in 3 colors:\n   <color=#3de306><b>Green</b></color>       , <color=#ffc600><b>Gold</b></color>       
      & <color=#eb3619><b>Red</b></color>       . \n\n- When any <b>Wild</b> appears,
      it gets collected onto\n   the <b>Wild Progression</b> of the same color.\n\n-
      Whenever <b>Wild</b> lands, there is a chance it may\n   trigger relevant <style=coinColor><b>Free
      Games</b></style>:\n    -       triggers <color=#3de306><b>Green Fish Free
      Games</b></color>. \n    -       triggers <color=#ffc600><b>Gold Fish Free
      Games</b></color>.\n    -       triggers <color=#eb3619><b>Red Fish Free Games</b></color>.
      \n\n- Trigger <b>ANY TWO</b> for <style=coinColor><b>Combo Free Games</b></style>.\n\n-
      Trigger <b>ALL Three</b> for <color=#e400ff><b>Super Free Games</b></color>."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_5
    value: <style=title><size=34><color=#13ebff>FREE GAMES</style></size></color>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_5
    value: "<size=24>- During <color=#3de306><b>Green Fish Free Games</b></color>,
      each spin, <b>2x</b>, <b>3x</b>\n   or <b>5x multiplier</b> gets applied to
      all line wins.\n\n- During <color=#ffc600><b>Gold Fish Free Games</b></color>,
      any landed <b>Wild</b>\n   awards <b>+1</b>, <b>+2 Free Spins</b> or <b>Coin
      Prize</b>.\n\n- During <color=#eb3619><b>Red Fish Free Games</b></color>, any
      landed <b>Wild</b>\n   gets <b>locked on a spot</b> during Free Games."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_13
    value: <style=title><size=34><color=#13ebff>COMBO FREE GAMES</style></size></color>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_14
    value: "<size=24><b>- During <color=#3de306>Green</color> & <color=#ffc600>Gold</color>
      Fish <style=coinColor>Combo Free Games</style>:</b>\n     - Any landed <b>Wild</b>
      awards <b>+1</b>, <b>+2 Free Spins</b>\n        or <b>Coin Prize</b>.\n    
      - Each spin, <b>2x</b>, <b>3x</b> or <b>5x multiplier</b> gets applied\n       
      to all line wins.\n<b>- During <color=#ffc600>Gold</color> & <color=#eb3619>Red</color>
      Fish <style=coinColor>Combo Free Games</style>:</b>\n     - Any landed <b>Wild</b>
      gets <b>locked on a spot</b> and\n        awards <b>+1</b>, <b>+2 Free Spins</b>
      or <b>Coin Prize</b>.\n<b>- During <color=#3de306>Green</color> & <color=#eb3619>Red</color>
      Fish <style=coinColor>Combo Free Games</style>:</b>\n     - Each spin <b>2x</b>,
      <b>3x</b> or <b>5x multiplier</b> gets applied\n        to all line wins.\n    
      - Any landed <b>Wild</b> gets <b>locked on a spot</b> during\n        Free
      Games.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_14
    value: <style=title><size=34><color=#13ebff>SUPER FREE GAMES</style></size></color>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_15
    value: "<size=24><b>- During <color=#3de306>Green</color>, <color=#ffc600>Gold</color>
      & <color=#eb3619>Red</color> Fish\n   <color=#e400ff>Super Free Games</color>:</b>\n    
      - Any landed <b>Wild</b> awards <b>+1</b>, <b>+2 Free Spins</b>\n        or
      <b>Coin Prize</b>.\n     - Each spin, <b>2x</b>, <b>3x</b> or <b>5x multiplier</b>
      gets applied\n        to all line wins.\n     - Any landed <b>Wild</b> gets
      <b>locked on a spot</b> during\n        Free Games.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_16
    value: "<size=24>- In ANY Free Games, <b>one or more</b> types of\n   Free Games
      can be triggered, <b>BUT</b> in given\n   Free Game, each Free Game type can
      be\n   triggered <b>ONLY ONCE</b>.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_15
    value: <style=title><size=34><color=#13ebff>SUPER PROGRESSION FEATURE</style></size></color>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_17
    value: "<size=24>- <b>Sub-Symbol</b>          can appear with any symbol\n  
      in the Base Game.\n\n- Every time          appears, it fills up the\n   <b>Super
      Progression</b>. \n\n- Once <b>Super Progression</b> gets fully filled\n  
      with         , it triggers <b><style=coinColor>Pick Bonus Game</style></b>.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_16
    value: <style=title><size=34><color=#13ebff>PICK BONUS GAME</style></size></color>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_18
    value: "<size=24>- <b>ONLY 1 Pick</b> is provided during \n   <b>Pick Bonus Game</b>.
      \n- Once triggered, one of the following can be\n   awarded:\n     - <b><color=#3de306>Green</color>
      & <color=#ffc600>Gold</color> Fish Combo Free Games</b>\n     - <b><color=#ffc600>Gold</color>
      & <color=#eb3619>Red</color> Fish Combo Free Games</b>\n     - <b><color=#3de306>Green</color>
      & <color=#eb3619>Red</color> Fish Combo Free Games</b>\n     - <b><color=#3de306>Green</color>
      & <color=#ffc600>Gold</color> & <color=#eb3619>Red</color> Fish Super Free
      Games</b>\n     - <b><style=coinColor>MEGA Jackpot</style></b>\n     - <b><color=#e400ff>GRAND
      Jackpot</color></b></size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><size=34><color=#13ebff>LINES</style></size></color>
